cff-version: 1.2.0
authors:
  - alias: supalite
title: "The Verifier Is the Asset: Manufacturing Training Data for Domain-Specialised Code Models"
message: "If you use this method or these results, please cite this repository."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A method for manufacturing execution-verified training data for code models in domains
  where correctness is decidable, adapting mutation testing to data synthesis. Includes
  per-task evaluation results and a corpus provenance manifest.
keywords:
  - code generation
  - synthetic data
  - mutation testing
  - Roblox Luau
  - program verification
